{
  "rationale": "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion; specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, coverage-oriented actions. Recovery is conservative but returns to exploration as soon as possible. All uncontrollable events are total in every state. No state reached by obstacle events enables forward/random_walk. Only one controllable per non-terminal state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model perception and motion as separate plants to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, coverage-biased exploration with conservative obstacle recovery and rapid return to forward progress."
